        "quote": "护士、管床/手术医生、麻醉医生，三个环节都说一遍、都给看一遍。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00078",
        "explanation": "The caregiver provided teach-back but ended with an unanswered confirmation question.",
        "quote": "要不要再加一句“术前必要时抗凝不是回家自己吃药”"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "A safe medication and document-carrying plan was largely executable, and the caregiver demonstrated understanding. The episode is still best treated as questionably open because the final caregiver teach-back requested confirmation/addition and the doctor did not respond, and a precise pre-op contact timing remained under-specified.",
