          "quote": "这瓶旧阿司匹林**这次任务就是带给医生看**"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Beyond simply saying not to self-medicate, the doctor verified ambiguity by asking for drug-box details and instructing the family to bring old aspirin and all medication boxes for clinical review, preventing both mistaken use and mistaken omission.",
